sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a TxDefaultProfile<br>charging profile with limitAtSoc specified

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest (chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose = TxDefaultProfile, chargingProfile.chargingSchedule.limitAtSoC)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose must be TxDefaultProfile<br>chargingProfile.chargingSchedule.limitAtSoC must be not omitted

    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)
